Z||000012||California Kid||08-03-2001||05:56 PM||||[QUOTE]Originally posted by ChadMan:<BR>[B]Bob Lutz, father of the Viper, is a car guy, not a bean counter.  Maybe we'll start seeing some innovative cars from the General again.<P>Some of the "Insiders" at GM are worried that he'll work a deal to sell GM to the Japanese !!! GM is in a lot of trouble right now, so who knows! Bob's a great guy for bringing out interesting models, but you have to wonder what really went on at Chrysler, that lead to the German buyout??<P>Should be very interesting, remember that Bob got cars launched in a two year time frame!!!<BR>||||reg||1
